.claude/

# internal reference, not distributed (documented in DOCUMENTATION.md instead)
REPRODUCE.md

# release artifacts: intermediate build output stays out of the repository, but a
# tagged release folder is committed so the published binaries are browsable here
# as well as on the Releases page. Order matters — these negations must follow the
# *.exe rule above, since git applies the last pattern that matches, and the
# directory has to be re-included before anything inside it can be.
dist/*
!dist/v0.6.0/
!dist/v0.6.0/**
!dist/v0.7.0/
!dist/v0.7.0/**
!dist/v0.8.0/
!dist/v0.8.0/**
